BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 542.4 Tm (Q: Please describe your role and your last weeks at Halvorsen.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 519.4 Tm (I was a senior engineer at Halvorsen for a little over four years. I handed in my notice on Monday 2) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 504.4 Tm (March and spent the rest of the week on handover. Friday 6 March was my last day.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 481.4 Tm (Q: Where were you on the evening of Wednesday 4 March?) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 458.4 Tm (I was at my desk in 217 in the afternoon, finishing handover notes.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 435.4 Tm (I went straight home at six.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 412.4 Tm (Q: Did you attend the summit welcome reception?) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 389.4 Tm (No. I was tired and not in the mood for a crowd.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 366.4 Tm (Q: Did you go into room 219 that day?) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 343.4 Tm (My access to 219 was removed on the Monday. I answered the question about the files in my email) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 57.6 328.4 Tm (this morning.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
